{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10124410","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10124410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1012441001:0":{"text":"브라이언, 엘로나가 뭐라고 한 거야? 뭔가 초조해 보이는데.","source_cn":"布莱恩，艾洛娜和你说什么了？它好像很着急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF052CDDDFA1FA309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012441002:0":{"text":"타란 마을의 상황이 걱정되서 엘로나를 보냈습니다.","source_cn":"我担心塔兰村的情况，派艾洛娜回去了一趟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED40D56E2C240702","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012441003:0":{"text":"엘로나 말로는 황혼의 나무의 영향으로 연인의 소원의 부패가 점점 더 심각해졌고, 휴윈의 상태도... 매우 좋지 않다는군요.","source_cn":"它告诉我，受流荧树影响，情人之愿的腐化越来越严重，而伊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F0EC95A5FCC681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012441004:1":{"text":"가능한 빨리 타란 마을로 돌아가야 할 것 같습니다.","source_cn":"恐怕我们得尽快返回塔兰村。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED20F8419D5DBA87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012441005:1":{"text":"나도 휴윈이 걱정되지만 이미르를 계속 쫓아야 하지 않을까? 가까스로 그의 단서를 찾았는데.","source_cn":"虽然我也很担心伊温，但是，不继续追查伊米尔吗？好不容易...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1BCAE66B9B9BC26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012441006:1":{"text":"그가 더 멀리 도망치면, 다음엔 그를 어떻게 찾을 수 있겠어? 땅거미 숲을 해쳤으니, 반드시 대가를 치러야 해!","source_cn":"万一他跑得更远了，下次我们要如何才能找到他？他伤害了薄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x366B53A338C6A029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012441007:2":{"text":"누나, 내가 남을게.","source_cn":"姐，我留下来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AE4CC3B8D126F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012441008:1":{"text":"이미르가 이 근처에 숨어 있다면, 그의 소리를 들을 수 있을 거야! 이런 일은 내게 맡겨!","source_cn":"如果伊米尔真的躲在附近，我应该能听见他的声音！这种小事...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BB943F046BEACF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012441009:2":{"text":"함부로 나서지 마! 넌 그의 상대가 안 돼. 멋대로 행동해서는 안 된다고!","source_cn":"不许乱来！你不是他的对手，不准擅自行动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BD396F1F7C1F82C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012441010:2":{"text":"그를 남게 하시죠.","source_cn":"让他留下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x979F757C87D367D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012441011:2":{"text":"끼어들지 마! 로잔의 수준을 모르는 것도 아니잖아?","source_cn":"别添乱！洛桑的水平你还不清楚？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0B5093F1A0E2CCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012441012:1":{"text":"누나, 내가 알아서 할 테니 걱정하지 마. 위험이 닥치면 어떻게 도망가야 할지 아니까.","source_cn":"姐，我自有分寸，你别担心我了。遇到危险，我知道该如何逃跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2B41982F4F7AF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1012441012":{"text":"누나, 내가 알아서 할 테니 걱정하지 마. 위험이 닥치면 어떻게 도망가야 할지 아니까.","source_cn":"姐，我自有分寸，你别担心我了。遇到危险，我知道该如何逃跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2B41982F4F7AF38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012441013:1":{"text":"맞아요, 이길 순 없어도 위험이 닥치면 어디로 도망가야 할진 알아요.","source_cn":"对呀，就算打不过，遇到危险，我起码知道该往哪跑啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA65751460D0A76A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1012441015:1":{"text":"라이카, 에이론에게 했던 말 기억하세요? 자신이 할 수 없는 일을 남에게 강요할 순 없잖습니까?","source_cn":"莱卡，还记得你说给埃隆的话吗？自己都做不到的事，又怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22E729BBBCABC431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012441016:2":{"text":"난...\n알겠어... 정말 너에겐 못 당하겠네. 브라이언.","source_cn":"我……\\n好吧……真是败给你了，布莱恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3679041F7FDAA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012441017:1":{"text":"로잔, 자신을 잘 지키겠다고 약속해.","source_cn":"洛桑，你要答应我，必须保护好自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03BDB26714F6BA48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012441018:1":{"text":"당연하지! 어서 다녀와. 꼭 좋은 소식으로 다시 만나자고!","source_cn":"没问题！你们快去快回。等你们回来，我一定会用好消息迎接...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A59ACFCF1201DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"라이카, 로잔을 믿어줘야 해","source_cn":"莱卡，你要相信洛桑","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0F044B7C0CD6D89C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"라이카, 로잔을 믿어줘야 해","female":"라이카, 로잔을 믿어줘야 해","variant_male_record_index":"61072","variant_female_record_index":"61073","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012441014:1":{"text":"맞아요! 처음 멀린님을 만났을 때도 도망가던 중이었다고요!","source_cn":"没错！我还记得第一次遇见梅林大人，就是在逃跑的路上！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8B4BFBE19474B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아요! 처음 멀린님을 만났을 때도 도망가던 중이었다고요!","female":"맞아요! 처음 멀린님을 만났을 때도 도망가던 중이었다고요!","variant_male_record_index":"110128","variant_female_record_index":"110129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"로잔은 운이 좋으니까, 걱정 마","source_cn":"洛桑运气好，放心吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x20DB081FEBFB1433","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로잔은 운이 좋으니까, 걱정 마","female":"로잔은 운이 좋으니까, 걱정 마","variant_male_record_index":"61074","variant_female_record_index":"61075","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":3}}